{"2348250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "13Z: The Zodiac Trials", "steam_appid": 2348250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/91568d97dc76ef3bf5e9b2e121a581b4.avif?t=1786632841\" width=1412 height=292 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1786632841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras_big/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1786632841 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Zodiac Trials, where aspiring animal spirits from across the realms compete for a divine seat among the stars. Face demons, Guardians, and your own limits to claim the title of the <strong>13th Zodiac</strong> in this <strong>roguelike hack-and-slash</strong> inspired by <strong>Eastern mythology</strong>. You are the plucky underdog fighting for celestial glory — forge powerful builds, conquer shifting arenas, and rise stronger after every fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT FROM  UNIQUE CHALLENGERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the Trials with a cast of extraordinary animal spirits, each mastering a distinct combat style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fox</strong> – A lightning-fast swordswoman whose strikes flash like thunder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven</strong> – A graceful reaper who commands razor-sharp feathers from above.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to follow</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a fresh climb toward greatness. Master diverse characters, craft your playstyle through <strong>deep upgrades and modifiers</strong>, and unlock new powers that change how every encounter unfolds. No two trials are ever the same — each victory and defeat reshapes your path through the celestial realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR AS A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode</strong> – Sharpen your skills in a single-player action roguelike experience built for fluid combat, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode (2–4 Players)</strong> – Join forces with friends to face tougher enemies, stronger bosses, and even moral temptations that can test your teamwork and resolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re new to the genre or a seasoned action roguelike veteran, <strong>13Z: The Zodiac Trials</strong> offers a challenge that grows with you. Each run is a dance of grit, speed, and power against hordes of foes and cunning Guardians. Triumph through adaptability, clever builds, and relentless spirit — and you may yet carve your name among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials await the next legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seize the mantle and become the <strong>13th Zodiac Guardian</strong>?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1786632841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras_big/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1786632841 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Zodiac Trials, where aspiring animal spirits from across the realms compete for a divine seat among the stars. Face demons, Guardians, and your own limits to claim the title of the <strong>13th Zodiac</strong> in this <strong>roguelike hack-and-slash</strong> inspired by <strong>Eastern mythology</strong>. You are the plucky underdog fighting for celestial glory — forge powerful builds, conquer shifting arenas, and rise stronger after every fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT FROM  UNIQUE CHALLENGERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the Trials with a cast of extraordinary animal spirits, each mastering a distinct combat style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fox</strong> – A lightning-fast swordswoman whose strikes flash like thunder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven</strong> – A graceful reaper who commands razor-sharp feathers from above.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to follow</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a fresh climb toward greatness. Master diverse characters, craft your playstyle through <strong>deep upgrades and modifiers</strong>, and unlock new powers that change how every encounter unfolds. No two trials are ever the same — each victory and defeat reshapes your path through the celestial realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR AS A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode</strong> – Sharpen your skills in a single-player action roguelike experience built for fluid combat, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode (2–4 Players)</strong> – Join forces with friends to face tougher enemies, stronger bosses, and even moral temptations that can test your teamwork and resolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re new to the genre or a seasoned action roguelike veteran, <strong>13Z: The Zodiac Trials</strong> offers a challenge that grows with you. Each run is a dance of grit, speed, and power against hordes of foes and cunning Guardians. Triumph through adaptability, clever builds, and relentless spirit — and you may yet carve your name among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.poster.avif?t=1786632841\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.webm?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.mp4?t=1786632841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials await the next legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seize the mantle and become the <strong>13th Zodiac Guardian</strong>?</p>", "short_description": "Go solo or team up with up to three friends in online co-op for this fast-paced, anime-inspired action roguelike. Master stylish hack and slash combat, craft overpowered builds, and conquer mythological trials to claim the title of the thirteenth Zodiac.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/db85a688ff885e25c239400b53f13998e3def783/header.jpg?t=1786632841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/f412e70bde853e9d3a08085ed04662814f8f6ef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786632841", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/f412e70bde853e9d3a08085ed04662814f8f6ef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786632841", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD FX-8320<br>